# An allowlist for a DIRECTORY build context. deploy/relay/build.sh builds from `git archive` (tracked files only) on
# stdin, where Docker did not apply this file (the test stage's /src held docs/ too), and none of the untracked files
# named here can reach an image that way anyway. These lines are for the next person who runs `docker build .` by
# hand, from a checkout that holds the cliproxy's OAuth tokens (auths/), its config.yaml and the relay's own (client
# token and upstream key). The runtime stage copies only server.py, lokki_core/ and healthcheck.py.
*
!core
!deploy/relay
core/config.yaml
core/config.yaml.*
core/runs.jsonl*
core/e2e_evidence.jsonl
core/billing_*.json*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.log
**/.relay_token.local
**/.relay-e2e-config*.yaml
